  <description>Shared base body for the mpi 5 m blimp SITL variants: 5.00 m x 2.00 m spheroid hull (fineness 2.5), gondola, cruciform tail visuals, standard PX4 sensor suite, buoyancy-neutral mass budget. Not meant to be spawned directly - use a propulsion variant such as airship_mpi_rigid that includes it.</description>
